&lt;img title=&quot;Source : Inner Sea Races/Races de la mer Int&#233;rieure&quot; class=&quot;opachover&quot; src=&quot;/Wiki/public/Upload/Illustrations/Logos/logoISR.gif&quot; style=&quot;opacity: 0.7&quot; loop=&quot;infinite&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;&lt;i&gt;Quand vous &#234;tes en compagnie d&#39;autres aliens, vos pens&#233;es deviennent difficiles &#224; suivre.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cat&#233;gorie :&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Dons.html#DONEQUIPE&quot; title=&quot;Les dons&quot;&gt;&#233;quipe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;b&gt;Conditions.&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Andro&#239;de-(Race).html&quot; title=&quot;Les andro&#239;des&quot;&gt;Andro&#239;de&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Kasatha-(Race).html&quot; title=&quot;Les kasathas&quot;&gt;kasatha&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Lashunta-(Race).html&quot; title=&quot;Les lashuntas&quot;&gt;lashunta&lt;/a&gt; ou &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Triaxien-(Race).html&quot; title=&quot;Les triaxiens&quot;&gt;triaxien&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;b&gt;Avantages.&lt;/b&gt; Tant que le personnage est adjacent &#224; au moins un autre &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Andro&#239;de-(Race).html&quot; title=&quot;Les andro&#239;des&quot;&gt;andro&#239;de&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Kasatha-(Race).html&quot; title=&quot;Les kasathas&quot;&gt;kasatha&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Lashunta-(Race).html&quot; title=&quot;Les lashuntas&quot;&gt;lashunta&lt;/a&gt; ou &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Triaxien-(Race).html&quot; title=&quot;Les triaxiens&quot;&gt;triaxien&lt;/a&gt; qui poss&#232;de ce don, il b&#233;n&#233;ficie d&#39;un bonus de circonstances de +4 aux &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Valeurs-De-Combat#Jetdesauvegarde.html&quot; title=&quot;JDS&quot;&gt;jets de sauvegarde&lt;/a&gt; contre les &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Cr&#233;er-Un-Sort#Registre.html&quot; title=&quot;Registre&quot;&gt;effets mentaux&lt;/a&gt; et de &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Pr&#233;sentation-Des-Sorts#Scrutation.html&quot; title=&quot;Scrutation&quot;&gt;divination (scrutation)&lt;/a&gt;, &#224; moins que l&#39;effet ne provienne d&#39;un andro&#239;de, d&#39;un kasatha, d&#39;un lashunta ou d&#39;un triaxien.
